Z||000017||NEPTUNE||09-11-2001||11:42 AM||||YEP, INSURANCE WILL TAKE 30 DAYS, THEY ARE HOPING THE CAR WILL BE RECOVERED. YOUR POLICY ALLOWS THIS. IF NOT RECOVERED, OR RECOVERED DAMAGED (TOTAL LOSS) THEY OWE "ACTUAL CASH VALUE" AT TIME OF LOSS.<BR>IF YOU DISAGREE WITH THEIR ACTUAL CASH VALUE SETTLEMENT FIGURE, YOU HAVE THE RIGHT TO HIRE (@ YOUR OWN EXPENSE) AN INDEPENDENT APRAISER.( APPROX$100 US) DON'T SETTLE FOR LESS THAN THE CAR IS WORTH! THIS PROCESS IS SIMILAR TO HAGGLING WITH A CAR DEALER OVER PRICE OF A NEW/USED CAR. ACV IS DETERMINED BY AVERAGE PRICE OF SIMILAR CARS FOR SALE /SOLD IN YOUR GEOGRAPHIC AREA.  ||||reg||3
